# type(scope): describe the concrete change (English, <= 100 characters)
# Types: feat fix perf refactor docs test build ci chore revert release
# Keep each independent feature/fix in its own commit.
#
# For a substantial change, explain its trigger, resulting behavior and reason.
# Record actual validation and relevant limitations without inventing results.
# For incompatible changes use ! and explain migration in BREAKING CHANGE:.
